Use your stored vim to supercharge your body, recovering [28, 38, 46, 52, 58 (TL1-5; SP 100)] stamina and [120, 162, 195, 222, 247 (TL1-5; SP 100)] life.

Additionally, you will be able to survive your HP going under 0, down to [-153, -206, -247, -282, -312 (TL1-5; SP 100)] HP, for the next 8 turns.

These values will increase with your Spellpower.

Spell criticals with this talent also effect the stamina gain.
